#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:86
msgid ""
"Full Isaac Sim workflows require Python 3.12 on Ubuntu 22.04+ or Windows 11."
" Use a recent NVIDIA production driver and a workstation with at least 32 GB"
" RAM and 16 GB GPU VRAM. Rendering can require additional VRAM. Confirm your"
" machine against the `Isaac Sim system requirements "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/requirements.html>`__"
" and `Omniverse technical requirements "
"<https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/materials-and-"
"rendering/latest/common/technical-requirements.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"完整的 Isaac Sim 工作流程需要在 Ubuntu 22.04 及以上版本或 Windows 11 上使用 Python "
"3.12。工作站应安装较新的 NVIDIA 生产分支驱动，并至少配备 32 GB 内存和 16 GB GPU 显存。渲染可能需要更多显存。请对照 "
"`Isaac Sim 系统要求 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/requirements.html>`__"
" 和 `Omniverse 技术要求 <https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/materials-and-"
"rendering/latest/common/technical-requirements.html>`__ ，确认机器配置符合要求。"

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:93
msgid ""
"Isaac Sim 5.1 and older are not supported. Use Isaac Sim 6.1 with Python "
"3.12."
msgstr "不支持 Isaac Sim 5.1 及更早版本。请使用 Isaac Sim 6.1 和 Python 3.12。"

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:95
msgid ""
"The CUDA 13.0 PyTorch build requires NVIDIA driver ``580.65.06`` or newer on"
" Linux and ``580.88`` or newer on Windows, as documented in the `PyTorch "
"CUDA 13.0 requirements <https://pytorch.org/blog/pytorch-2-12-release-"
"blog/>`__. CUDA 13.0 wheels support Blackwell GPUs."
msgstr ""
"CUDA 13.0 版 PyTorch 在 Linux 上要求 NVIDIA 驱动版本不低于 ``580.65.06`` ，在 Windows 上不低于"
" ``580.88`` ，详见 `PyTorch CUDA 13.0 要求 "
"<https://pytorch.org/blog/pytorch-2-12-release-blog/>`__ 。CUDA 13.0 wheel 支持"
" Blackwell GPU。"

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:99
msgid ""
"Use the latest NVIDIA production branch driver. Version ``580.95.05`` or "
"later is recommended on Linux x86_64 and aarch64, ``580.142`` on DGX Spark, "
"and ``581.42.00`` on Windows. If a new GPU or driver issue requires a newer "
"release, use the production driver from the `Unix Driver Archive "
"<https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/drivers/unix/>`__. On Linux, the `Isaac Sim "
"Compatibility Checker "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/install_workstation.html#isaac-"
"sim-compatibility-checker>`__ and `Linux troubleshooting guide "
"<https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/dev-guide/latest/linux-"
"troubleshooting.html>`__ can identify unsupported host configurations."
msgstr ""
"请使用最新的 NVIDIA 生产分支驱动。Linux x86_64 和 aarch64 推荐 ``580.95.05`` 或更高版本，DGX Spark"
" 推荐 ``580.142`` ，Windows 推荐 ``581.42.00`` 。如果新 GPU 或驱动问题需要更新版本，请从 `Unix 驱动归档"
" <https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/drivers/unix/>`__ 获取生产分支驱动。在 Linux 上，可以使用 "
"`Isaac Sim 兼容性检查器 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/install_workstation.html#isaac-"
"sim-compatibility-checker>`__ 和 `Linux 故障排查指南 "
"<https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/dev-guide/latest/linux-"
"troubleshooting.html>`__ ，识别不受支持的主机配置。"

