#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:227
msgid ""
"``uv run`` installs the core dependencies automatically. The ``--extra "
"<name>`` option includes the selected optional integration in the command's "
"environment. Place it before ``isaaclab``; for example, ``--extra ov`` "
"installs both ovphysx and ovrtx backends. Pass a comma-separated list or "
"repeat ``--extra``. No extras conflict, so any combination resolves into one"
" environment. The ``--extra all`` shortcut installs the curated ``ov``, "
"``rl-games``, ``sb3``, ``skrl``, ``rsl-rl``, ``rerun``, and ``viser`` "
"extras. It does not include Isaac Sim or the specialized ``skrl-jax``, "
"``rlinf``, ``mimic``, ``teleop``, ``tetrahedralization``, ``video``, and "
"``leapp`` extras; request them by name:"
msgstr ""
"``uv run`` 自动安装核心依赖。``--extra <name>`` 将选定的可选集成加入该命令的运行环境，应放在 ``isaaclab`` "
"前，例如 ``--extra ov`` 同时安装 ovphysx 和 ovrtx 后端。可以传入逗号分隔的列表，或重复使用 "
"``--extra``。各可选依赖组之间没有冲突，可以组合安装到同一环境。``--extra all`` 安装经过筛选的 ``ov``、``rl-"
"games``、``sb3``、``skrl``、``rsl-rl``、``rerun`` 和 ``viser`` 依赖组，不包含 Isaac "
"Sim，也不包含 ``skrl-"
"jax``、``rlinf``、``mimic``、``teleop``、``tetrahedralization``、``video``、``leapp``"
" 等专用依赖组；需要按名称明确指定："

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:241
msgid "See :ref:`installation-optional-extras` for the available extras."
msgstr "可用的可选依赖组见 :ref:`installation-optional-extras` 。"

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:243
msgid ""
"``uv run --extra <name> <command>`` syncs the selected extra into the "
"project environment and then runs the command."
msgstr "``uv run --extra <name> <command>`` 会先将选定的可选依赖组同步到项目环境，再运行命令。"

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:246
msgid ""
"The source checkout selects PyTorch's CUDA 13.0 build on Linux x86_64, Linux"
" aarch64, and Windows. No additional command flags are needed. The aggregate"
" wheel uses platform-specific CUDA PyTorch wheel URLs from the source "
"lockfile. This also selects CUDA builds for ``uvx`` and downstream projects,"
" which do not inherit a dependency project's ``tool.uv.sources`` settings. "
"The wheel supports Python 3.12, matching the source checkout."
msgstr ""
"从源码工作副本运行时，Linux x86_64、Linux aarch64 和 Windows 平台均会选择 PyTorch 的 CUDA 13.0 "
"构建，无需额外命令行参数。聚合 wheel 使用源码锁文件中各平台对应的 CUDA PyTorch wheel URL，因此 ``uvx`` "
"和下游项目也会选用 CUDA 构建；它们不会继承依赖项目的 ``tool.uv.sources`` 设置。该 wheel 支持 Python "
"3.12，与源码工作副本一致。"

