"installation troubleshooting links above if the source build does not "
"launch."
msgstr "教程命令应打开一个黑色的仿真器视口。如果源码构建版本无法启动，请使用上方二进制安装部分的故障排查链接。"

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:1035
msgid ""
"Install `Docker Engine <https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/>`__, `Docker"
" Compose <https://docs.docker.com/compose/install/>`__, and the `NVIDIA "
"Container Toolkit <https://docs.nvidia.com/datacenter/cloud-"
"native/container-toolkit/latest/install-guide.html>`__. Place the Isaac Lab "
"checkout under ``/home`` when Docker was installed with Snap."
msgstr ""
"安装 `Docker Engine <https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/>`__ 、 `Docker "
"Compose <https://docs.docker.com/compose/install/>`__ 和 `NVIDIA Container "
"Toolkit <https://docs.nvidia.com/datacenter/cloud-native/container-"
"toolkit/latest/install-guide.html>`__ 。如果 Docker 通过 Snap 安装，请将 Isaac Lab "
"仓库放在 ``/home`` 下。"

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:1040
msgid ""
"Clone Isaac Lab, then build, start, and enter the development container:"
msgstr "克隆 Isaac Lab，然后构建、启动并进入开发容器："

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:1049
msgid ""
"The container uses ``/isaac-sim/python.sh`` and mounts the repository's "
"``source`` and ``docs`` directories for live editing. Use "
"``./docker/container.py stop`` to stop it and ``./docker/container.py copy``"
" to retrieve logs, data, and documentation artifacts."
msgstr ""
"容器使用 ``/isaac-sim/python.sh`` ，并挂载仓库的 ``source`` 和 ``docs`` 目录，以便直接编辑。使用 "
"``./docker/container.py stop`` 停止容器，使用 ``./docker/container.py copy`` "
"获取日志、数据和文档构建产物。"

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:1053
msgid ""
"For HPC, build the image on a machine with Docker, convert it to an "
"Apptainer/Singularity image, and submit it with the cluster's SLURM or PBS "
"workflow. Keep cluster-specific paths and scheduler settings outside the "
"base image."
msgstr ""
"对于高性能计算集群，先在安装了 Docker 的机器上构建镜像，再转换为 Apptainer/Singularity 镜像，并通过集群的 SLURM 或"
" PBS 提交任务。集群专用路径和调度器设置应放在基础镜像之外。"

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:1057
msgid ""
"See :ref:`docker-cloud` for volume management, X11, image extensions, pre-"
"built containers, worked examples, and complete cluster instructions."
msgstr "卷管理、X11、镜像扩展、预构建容器、完整示例及集群操作说明见 :ref:`docker-cloud` 。"

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:1065
msgid ""
"Isaac Automator provisions GPU workstations on AWS, GCP, Azure, and Alibaba "
"Cloud. Install Docker, then clone and build Isaac Automator:"
msgstr ""
"Isaac Automator 可在 AWS、GCP、Azure 和阿里云上创建 GPU 工作站。先安装 Docker，再克隆并构建 Isaac "
"Automator："

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:1075
msgid ""
"Replace ``deploy-aws`` with ``deploy-gcp``, ``deploy-azure``, or ``deploy-"
"alicloud``. Use ``--isaaclab`` and ``--isaacsim`` to select Git revisions. "
"Connection details for SSH, noVNC, and NoMachine are stored in "
"``state/<deployment-name>/info.txt``."
msgstr ""
"根据云平台，将 ``deploy-aws`` 替换为 ``deploy-gcp`` 、 ``deploy-azure`` 或 ``deploy-"
"alicloud`` 。通过 ``--isaaclab`` 和 ``--isaacsim`` 选择 Git 版本。SSH、noVNC 和 "
"NoMachine 的连接信息保存在 ``state/<deployment-name>/info.txt`` 中。"

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:1079
msgid "Manage the workstation from the Automator container:"
msgstr "在 Automator 容器中管理工作站："

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:1089
msgid ""
"Preserve the ``state`` directory because it contains the deployment "
"metadata."
msgstr "请保留 ``state`` 目录，其中包含部署元数据。"

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:1091
msgid ""
"See :ref:`docker-cloud-cloud` for credentials, provider options, connection "
"methods, data transfer, and the complete workstation lifecycle."
msgstr "凭据、云平台选项、连接方式、数据传输及完整的工作站生命周期说明见 :ref:`docker-cloud-cloud` 。"

#: source/setup/installation/index.rst:1095
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

